{"seq":1,"slug":"yeast-biochemistry","title":"酵母发酵的生物化学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/baking-science/leavening-fermentation/yeast-biochemistry","wordCount":2169,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"酵母发酵的生物化学\">酵母发酵的生物化学</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>酿酒酵母（<em>Saccharomyces cerevisiae</em>）是烘焙中最重要的生物膨胀剂。这种单细胞真菌通过厌氧发酵将可发酵糖转化为二氧化碳和乙醇，前者赋予面包体积，后者在烘焙中挥发并贡献风味前体。酵母发酵不仅是产气过程——它同时产生数百种风味化合物、有机酸和酶解产物，是面包复杂风味形成的核心驱动力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[葡萄糖 C6H12O6] --&gt; B[糖酵解 EMP途径]&#10;    B --&gt; C[2 丙酮酸]&#10;    C --&gt; D{氧气条件}&#10;    D --&gt;|厌氧| E[丙酮酸脱羧]&#10;    D --&gt;|有氧| F[TCA循环]&#10;    E --&gt; G[乙醛]&#10;    G --&gt; H[乙醇 + CO2]&#10;    F --&gt; I[CO2 + H2O + ATP]&#10;    H --&gt; J[面团膨胀]&#10;    H --&gt; K[风味前体]\">flowchart TD\n    A[葡萄糖 C6H12O6] --&gt; B[糖酵解 EMP途径]\n    B --&gt; C[2 丙酮酸]\n    C --&gt; D{氧气条件}\n    D --&gt;|厌氧| E[丙酮酸脱羧]\n    D --&gt;|有氧| F[TCA循环]\n    E --&gt; G[乙醛]\n    G --&gt; H[乙醇 + CO2]\n    F --&gt; I[CO2 + H2O + ATP]\n    H --&gt; J[面团膨胀]\n    H --&gt; K[风味前体]</pre><p>酵母的酒精发酵总反应方程式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>12</mn></msub><msub><mtext>O</mtext><mn>6</mn></msub><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>酵母</mtext></mpadded></mover><mn>2</mn><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>5</mn></msub><mtext>OH</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>100.5</mn><mtext> kJ</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{C}_6\\text{H}_{12}\\text{O}_6 \\xrightarrow{\\text{酵母}} 2\\text{C}_2\\text{H}_5\\text{OH} + 2\\text{CO}_2 + 100.5 \\text{ kJ}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2503em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">酵母</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OH</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100.5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> kJ</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>理论产气量：1 mol 葡萄糖（180g）产生 2 mol <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（约 44.8 L 在 STP 下）。但实际面团中，部分糖被用于酵母生长和维持代谢，实际产气效率约为理论值的 40-60%。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>代谢参数</th>\n<th>数值</th>\n<th>条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最适生长温度</td>\n<td>28-32°C</td>\n<td>有氧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最适发酵温度</td>\n<td>35-38°C</td>\n<td>厌氧面团中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实用面团温度</td>\n<td>24-27°C</td>\n<td>平衡产气与风味</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pH 最适范围</td>\n<td>4.5-5.5</td>\n<td>面团典型 pH 5.0-5.5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>致死温度</td>\n<td>55-60°C</td>\n<td>烘焙早期失活</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高糖抑制阈值</td>\n<td>&gt;12% baker&#39;s %</td>\n<td>渗透压抑制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高盐抑制阈值</td>\n<td>&gt;2.5% baker&#39;s %</td>\n<td>质壁分离</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"酵母对糖的代谢优先级\">酵母对糖的代谢优先级</h2><p>面团中可供酵母利用的糖类来源多样，酵母对不同糖的代谢存在明确的优先级（Crabtree 效应和碳代谢物阻遏）：</p>\n<p><strong>第一优先级——游离葡萄糖和果糖</strong>：面粉天然含有约 0.5-1.0% 的游离单糖。酵母通过己糖转运蛋白（HXT 家族）直接摄入，无需额外酶解步骤。这些糖在搅拌后 15-30 分钟内即被耗尽。</p>\n<p><strong>第二优先级——蔗糖</strong>：酵母细胞壁外的转化酶（invertase）将蔗糖水解为葡萄糖和果糖后摄入。当配方中添加蔗糖时，这是发酵中期的主要碳源。</p>\n<p><strong>第三优先级——麦芽糖</strong>：面粉中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>-淀粉酶和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>-淀粉酶持续水解破损淀粉产生麦芽糖。酵母的麦芽糖透性酶（maltose permease）和麦芽糖酶（maltase）负责其利用。关键特征：当葡萄糖浓度 &gt;0.1% 时，麦芽糖代谢基因被阻遏——这导致发酵过程中存在一个&quot;代谢切换滞后期&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 糖源&#10;        A[游离糖 0.5-1%]&#10;        B[蔗糖 配方添加]&#10;        C[麦芽糖 淀粉酶产生]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 发酵时序&#10;        D[0-30min 消耗游离糖]&#10;        E[30-90min 水解蔗糖]&#10;        F[90min+ 麦芽糖利用]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt; D&#10;    B --&gt; E&#10;    C --&gt; F&#10;    D --&gt; G[产气速率快]&#10;    E --&gt; H[产气速率稳定]&#10;    F --&gt; I[持续低速产气]\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 糖源\n        A[游离糖 0.5-1%]\n        B[蔗糖 配方添加]\n        C[麦芽糖 淀粉酶产生]\n    end\n    subgraph 发酵时序\n        D[0-30min 消耗游离糖]\n        E[30-90min 水解蔗糖]\n        F[90min+ 麦芽糖利用]\n    end\n    A --&gt; D\n    B --&gt; E\n    C --&gt; F\n    D --&gt; G[产气速率快]\n    E --&gt; H[产气速率稳定]\n    F --&gt; I[持续低速产气]</pre><p>这个代谢优先级解释了为什么面包发酵曲线呈现先快后慢再缓升的三阶段模式。也解释了为什么无糖配方（法棍）的初始发酵较慢——完全依赖面粉天然游离糖和酶解生成的麦芽糖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"发酵动力学与产气曲线\">发酵动力学与产气曲线</h2><p>面团发酵的产气动力学可通过 Rheofermentometer 精确测量。该仪器同时记录面团高度（总产气）、逸出气体体积和面团内保留气体体积：</p>\n<p><strong>产气总量曲线</strong>：呈 S 形，前期为指数增长（酵母增殖 + 充裕糖源），中期为线性增长（稳态产气），后期为平台（糖源耗尽或乙醇抑制）。</p>\n<p><strong>持气能力</strong>：面团保留 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的百分比随发酵进行先升后降。初期面筋网络尚在发展，保气能力随面筋成熟而改善；后期面筋被过度拉伸或被有机酸弱化，保气能力下降——这定义了&quot;最佳发酵终点&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>发酵速率的 Arrhenius 关系</strong>：温度每升高 10°C，产气速率约增加 2-3 倍（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>10</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{10}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = 2-3）。但实用中不追求最快产气速率——27°C 的中等速率允许风味化合物充分积累，而 35°C 的快速发酵虽然节省时间但风味单一。</p>\n<p>发酵终点的判断方法：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>体积法：面团膨胀至 2-2.5 倍原始体积</li>\n<li>指压法：手指按压面团表面，凹痕缓慢回弹但不完全恢复</li>\n<li>温度时间法：根据面团温度查表确定发酵时长</li>\n<li>仪器法：Rheofermentometer 读数达到目标保气率下降点</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"酵母类型与特性\">酵母类型与特性</h2><p>商业酵母根据含水量和活性状态分为多种产品形态：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>酵母类型</th>\n<th>含水量</th>\n<th>保存条件</th>\n<th>使用量(baker&#39;s%)</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>压榨鲜酵母</td>\n<td>65-70%</td>\n<td>冷藏 4°C，2-4 周</td>\n<td>2-5%</td>\n<td>专业面包坊、风味最优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>活性干酵母 ADY</td>\n<td>5-8%</td>\n<td>常温密封，6-12 月</td>\n<td>1-2%</td>\n<td>家庭烘焙、需预活化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>即发干酵母 IDY</td>\n<td>3-5%</td>\n<td>常温密封，12-24 月</td>\n<td>0.5-1.5%</td>\n<td>工业化生产、直接加入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>耐高糖酵母</td>\n<td>3-5%</td>\n<td>常温密封</td>\n<td>1-2%</td>\n<td>甜面团（糖&gt;10%）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>天然酵种</td>\n<td>变化</td>\n<td>冷藏/室温喂养</td>\n<td>20-40%（以面粉计）</td>\n<td>酸面包、风味面包</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>鲜酵母含有完整活性细胞，发酵启动最快；干酵母经脱水处理细胞壁受损，需要复水激活时间。即发干酵母（IDY）的颗粒设计为可直接混入面粉，省去预活化步骤——其颗粒表面的乳化剂涂层促进快速水合。</p>\n<p>耐高糖酵母（osmotolerant yeast）通过积累海藻糖等相容性溶质抵抗高渗透压环境。在含糖 &gt;12% 的甜面团中，普通酵母因质壁分离而活性锐降，耐高糖酵母仍可正常产气。</p>\n<h2 id=\"发酵风味化学\">发酵风味化学</h2><p>酵母发酵产生的风味远超乙醇和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——数百种挥发性和非挥发性化合物共同构建面包的复杂香气：</p>\n<p><strong>醇类</strong>：除主产物乙醇外，酵母通过 Ehrlich 途径将氨基酸脱氨转化为高级醇（fusel alcohols）。亮氨酸 → 异戊醇（果香）、异亮氨酸 → 活性戊醇、苯丙氨酸 → 苯乙醇（玫瑰香）。</p>\n<p><strong>酯类</strong>：醇与有机酸在酵母胞内的酰基转移酶催化下形成酯。乙酸乙酯（溶剂香/果香）和乙酸异戊酯（香蕉香）是主要贡献者。发酵温度升高促进酯类生成。</p>\n<p><strong>羰基化合物</strong>：双乙酰（diacetyl，黄油香）由乙酰乳酸自发脱羧生成，是面包黄油风味的关键贡献者。面团中双乙酰含量随发酵时间先升后降（被酵母再吸收还原）。</p>\n<p><strong>有机酸</strong>：乙酸和乳酸是酸面团的特征风味物质。乙酸/乳酸比值（通常 1:4 到 1:8）决定了酸面包是&quot;尖锐刺激&quot;还是&quot;温和柔润&quot;。发酵温度影响此比值——低温（&lt;20°C）偏向乙酸，高温（&gt;30°C）偏向乳酸。</p>\n<p>长时间低温发酵（retardation）之所以产生更复杂风味，是因为：蛋白酶缓慢释放游离氨基酸 → Ehrlich 途径产生更多高级醇 → 长时间积累使微量风味物质达到感官阈值 → 美拉德前体（氨基酸 + 还原糖）在烘焙时产生更丰富的焙烤香。</p>\n<h2 id=\"酸面团发酵微生态\">酸面团发酵微生态</h2><p>酸面团（sourdough）是自然界最古老的发酵体系之一，由酵母和乳酸菌的稳定共生群落驱动。典型酸面团中乳酸菌与酵母的比例为 100:1，但两者的协作而非竞争关系决定了体系稳定性：</p>\n<p>主要微生物组成：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>酵母：<em>Kazachstania humilis</em>（原 <em>Candida humilis</em>）、<em>S. cerevisiae</em></li>\n<li>乳酸菌：<em>Fructilactobacillus sanfranciscensis</em>（原 <em>Lactobacillus sanfranciscensis</em>）、<em>Levilactobacillus brevis</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p>关键共生机制：<em>F. sanfranciscensis</em> 优先利用麦芽糖（面粉淀粉酶水解产物），释放葡萄糖到环境中供酵母使用；酵母不利用麦芽糖（缺乏麦芽糖透性酶），消耗葡萄糖后酵母转向利用果糖。这种代谢互补避免了直接竞争。</p>\n<p>酸面团的技术优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>延长保鲜期——有机酸抑制霉菌生长</li>\n<li>改善风味——复杂酸味 + 增强的美拉德反应</li>\n<li>提高营养——植酸降解释放矿物质</li>\n<li>降低血糖反应——有机酸减缓淀粉消化</li>\n<li>延缓老化——有机酸修饰淀粉回生行为</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>酵母发酵是烘焙中生物化学、微生物学和食品工程的交汇点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>酒精发酵的产气量由可发酵糖供给决定——面粉酶活性和配方加糖量是核心变量</li>\n<li>糖代谢的优先级导致发酵曲线的三阶段特征</li>\n<li>产气速率可通过温度、酵母量和糖浓度调控，但风味品质需要在速率与时间之间取平衡</li>\n<li>酵母类型选择取决于操作便利性、渗透压耐受和风味需求</li>\n<li>发酵风味来自 Ehrlich 途径、酯化反应和有机酸积累的协同贡献</li>\n<li>酸面团代表了发酵技术的最高复杂度——共生微生态带来多维度品质提升</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"酵母发酵的生物化学","id":"酵母发酵的生物化学"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"酵母对糖的代谢优先级","id":"酵母对糖的代谢优先级"},{"level":2,"text":"发酵动力学与产气曲线","id":"发酵动力学与产气曲线"},{"level":2,"text":"酵母类型与特性","id":"酵母类型与特性"},{"level":2,"text":"发酵风味化学","id":"发酵风味化学"},{"level":2,"text":"酸面团发酵微生态","id":"酸面团发酵微生态"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"面团流变学与水合控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/baking-science/flour-gluten/dough-rheology"},"next":{"title":"化学膨胀剂原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/baking-science/leavening-fermentation/chemical-leavening"}}